{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208280","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1120828001:0":{"text":"저게 밀크씨슬 아닌가요? 주변에 사나워 보이는 초코보가 있어요!","source_cn":"那是不是就是乳蓟？旁边还有一只看起来很凶恶的陆行鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90085414E6A77381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120828002:0":{"text":"아… 역시… 독이 있는 동물에게 물려서 해독하려고 밀크씨슬을 찾으러 온 모양이네.","source_cn":"啊……果然……那是被毒物咬伤过的动物，为了解毒来找乳蓟吃了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B68CFD8DB3FC808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120828003:0":{"text":"아이고 스승님, 제가 지금까지 많이 배우긴 했지만… 오늘은 정말 죄송합니다!","source_cn":"我这些门道，不少是从这些野生动物身上偷学的。今天对不住...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F9CBF6BCA738CD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德":{"text":"에디","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}